==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{m|non|lítill}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|is}} {{m|gem-pro|*lītilaz}}. Cognate with {{etyl|fo|-}} {{m|fo|lítil}}, {{etyl|da|-}} {{m|da|liden}}, {{etyl|no|-}} {{m|no|liten}}, {{etyl|sv|-}} {{m|sv|liten}}, {{etyl|ovd|-}} {{m|ovd|litn}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈliːtɪtl/|lang=is}}
*: {{rhymes|iːtɪtl|lang=is}}

===Adjective===
{{is-adj|minni|minnstur}}
# [[short]], [[small]]
# [[little]], [[insignificant]]

====Inflection====
{{is-decl-adj-lítill}}

